{
    "title": "The 1% Club TV",
    "description": "Official TV Quiz Game\r\n\r\nThe 1% Club is unlike most game shows! Our questions are designed to test logic and common sense to see how your brain actually works. It doesn't matter where you went to school - this show levels the playing field for everyone and no general knowledge is required to do well. Do you have what it takes to answer a question only 1% of the country would get right?\r\n\r\nPlay along with the 100 contestants in the studio from the comfort of your couch. Available to watch on Prime Video or Fox. \r\n\r\nWelcome to the new and improved The 1% Club TV quiz show app. Enjoy exclusive app quizzes, brand new features and access more games than ever before! \r\n\r\nPlay Along with the TV Show\r\n- See how you rank against the 100 contestants in the studio from the comfort of your sofa and play along with hit the show live on Fox or stream on Prime Video.\r\n\r\nQuestion Of The Day\r\n- Challenge yourself and build your streak with one new question a day, EVERY day! \r\n\r\nWeekly Games\r\n- Play entire new games every week taking you from 90% to 1% questions. Are you ready to take on new challenges?\r\n\r\nFollow the #The1PercentClub to discover more\r\n\r\nA network connection is required to play and enjoy the app. The 1% Club works best over Wi-Fi.",
